.TH CODE2PDF 1 "2026" "code2pdf" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
code2pdf \- print source code to PDF with a contents page and CJK support
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B code2pdf
.B \-s
.I FILE
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B code2pdf
.B \-a
.I DIR
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B code2pdf
converts one file, or every selected source file under a directory, into a PDF with
syntax highlighting, line numbers and bundled IBM Plex fonts.
.PP
With
.BR \-a ,
the result is
.IR DIR/merged.pdf :
a contents page grouped by folder with clickable page numbers and the printing date
(and git commit), then each file on a new page with its language, line count and last
change. Big directories are rendered in parts in separate processes to bound memory.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "\-s, \-\-single " FILE
Convert one file to
.I NAME.pdf
in the current directory.
.TP
.BI "\-a, \-\-all " DIR
Convert all selected files in
.I DIR
to
.IR DIR/merged.pdf .
.TP
.BI \-\-include\-types " LIST"
Only include these comma-separated extensions.
.TP
.BI \-\-ignore\-types " LIST"
Skip these extensions.
.TP
.BI \-\-ignore\-folders " LIST"
Skip these folder names (in addition to node_modules, build, dist, out, target, vendor, ...).
.TP
.BI \-\-ignore\-files " LIST"
Skip these file names.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-files
With
.BR \-a :
print the files that would be included, without converting.
.TP
.BI \-\-theme " NAME"
.B paper
(default, colour designed for print),
.B mono
(black and white), or any Pygments style.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-themes
Print all theme names.
.TP
.BI "\-j, \-\-jobs " N
Render big directories in
.I N
parts at a time (default 3 with 16 GB of RAM, 2 with 8 GB, else 1).
.TP
.B "\-q, \-\-quiet"
No progress output.
.TP
.B "\-V, \-\-version"
Show the version, how it is installed, library versions and the CJK font in use.
.TP
.B "\-h, \-\-help"
Show help.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CODE2PDF_THEME
Default theme.
.TP
.B CODE2PDF_JOBS
Default for
.BR \-\-jobs .
.TP
.B SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH
Fixed printing date, for reproducible output.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
code2pdf \-a .
code2pdf \-a src \-\-include\-types py,ts \-\-theme mono
code2pdf \-s main.go
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR code2txt (1)
.PP
https://github.com/readbysearch/code2pdf
